[0.308291,"o","\r\n\u001b[35m┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[35m│             ⚕ Hermes Agent Setup Wizard                │\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[35m├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.310657,"o","\u001b[35m│  Let's configure your Hermes Agent installation.       │\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[35m│  Press Ctrl+C at any time to exit.                     │\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[35m└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[?1049h\u001b[22;0;0t\u001b[1;30r\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4l\u001b[?7h\u001b[?1h\u001b=\u001b[39;49m\u001b[?25l\u001b[39;49m\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33mHow would you like to set up Hermes?\r\u001b[2d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;2m  ↑↓ navigate  ENTER/SPACE select  ESC cancel\r\u001b[4d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[32m → (●) Quick Setup (Nous Portal) — free OAuth login, no API keys, model + tools (recommended)\u001b[5;4H\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m(○) Full setup — configure every provider, tool & option yourself (bring your own keys)\u001b[6;4H(○) Blank Slate — everything off except the bare minimum; opt in to each capability"]
[0.613732,"o","\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33mHow would you like to set up Hermes?\r\u001b[2d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;2m  ↑↓ navigate  ENTER/SPACE select  ESC cancel\u001b[4;4H\u001b(B\u001b[m(●) Quick Setup (Nous Portal) — free OAuth login, no API keys, model + tools (recommended)\r\u001b[5d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[32m → (○) Full setup — configure every provider, tool & option yourself (bring your own keys)\u001b[6;4H\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m(○) Blank Slate — everything off except the bare minimum; opt in to each capability"]
[0.616407,"o","\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33mHow would you like to set up Hermes?\r\u001b[2d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;2m  ↑↓ navigate  ENTER/SPACE select  ESC cancel\u001b[4;4H\u001b(B\u001b[m(●) Quick Setup (Nous Portal) — free OAuth login, no API keys, model + tools (recommended)\u001b[5;4H(○) Full setup — configure every provider, tool & option yourself (bring your own keys)\r\u001b[6d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[32m → (○) Blank Slate — everything off except the bare minimum; opt in to each capability\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[?1l\u001b>\u001b[30;1H\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b[?1049l\u001b[23;0;0t\r\u001b[?1l\u001b>\r\n\r\n\r\n\u001b[36m\u001b[1m◆ Blank Slate Setup\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  Everything starts OFF. First we force-enable only what's required\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  to run an agent, then you choose whether to stop there or walk\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  through enabling more — opting in to exactly what you want.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  Forced on: Provider & Model, File Operations, Terminal, Vision, Skills.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  Everything else (web, browser, code exec, memory,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  delegation, cron, plugins, MCP, …) starts disabled. The\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  essential `hermes-agent` skill is always kept so the agent\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  can help you drive and configure Hermes itself.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\r\n\u001b[36m\u001b[1m◆ Step 1 — Provider & Model (required)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[36m\u001b[1m◆ Inference Provider\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  Choose how to connect to your main chat model.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m     Guide: https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/docs/integrations/providers\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[1.488109,"o","Warning: No inference provider configured. Run 'hermes model' to choose a provider and model, or set an API key (OPENROUTER_API_KEY, OPENAI_API_KEY, etc.) in ~/.hermes/.env. Falling back to auto provider detection.\r\n"]
[1.572785,"o","\r\n  Current model:    (not set)\r\n  Active provider:  none\r\n\r\n"]
[1.574733,"o","\u001b[?1049h\u001b[22;0;0t\u001b[1;30r\u001b[?25l\u001b[39;49m\u001b]104\u0007\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4l\u001b[?7h\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33mHow would you like to set up Hermes?\r\u001b[2d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;2m  ↑↓ navigate  ENTER/SPACE select  ESC cancel\u001b[4;4H\u001b(B\u001b[m(●) Quick Setup (Nous Portal) — free OAuth login, no API keys, model + tools (recommended)\u001b[5;4H(○) Full setup — configure every provider, tool & option yourself (bring your own keys)\r\u001b[6d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[32m → (○) Blank Slate — everything off except the bare minimum; opt in to each capability\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[?1h\u001b=\u001b[39;49m\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33mSelect provider:\r\u001b[2d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;2m  ↑↓ navigate  ENTER/SPACE select  ESC cancel\r\u001b[4d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[32m → (●) Nous Portal (Everything your agent needs, 300+ models with bundled tool use)\u001b[5;4H\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m(○) Fireworks AI (OpenAI-compatible direct model API)\u001b[6;4H(○) OpenRouter (Pay-per-use API aggregator)\u001b[7;4H(○) Mixture of Agents (named presets; aggregator acts after reference models)\u001b[8;4H(○) NovitaAI (Cloud: Model API, Agent Sandbox, GPU Cloud)\u001b[9;4H(○) LM Studio (Local desktop app with built-in model server)\u001b[10;4H(○) Anthropic (Claude models via API key or Claude Code)\u001b[11;4H(○) OpenAI ▸ (ChatGPT/Codex subscription or direct OpenAI API)\u001b[12;4H(○) Qwen ▸ (Qwen Cloud / DashScope, Coding Plan, Token Plan & Qwen CLI OAuth)\u001b[13;4H(○) xAI Grok ▸ (Direct API or SuperGrok / Premium+ OAuth)\u001b[14;4H(○) Xiaomi MiMo (MiMo-V2.5 and V2 models: pro, omni, flash)\u001b[15;4H(○) Tencent Hy ▸ (Hy4 / Hy3 via TokenHub & TokenPlan)\u001b[16;4H(○) NVIDIA NIM (Nemotron models via build.nvidia.com or local NIM)\u001b[17;4H(○) GitHub Copilot ▸ (GitHub token API or copilot --acp process)\u001b[18;4H(○) Hugging Face Inference Providers\u001b[19;4H(○) Google AI Studio (Native Gemini API)\u001b[20;4H(○) Google Vertex AI (Gemini via GCP; OAuth2 service account or ADC, GCP billing/quotas)\u001b[21;4H(○) DeepSeek (V3, R1, coder, direct API)\u001b[22;4H(○) Z.AI / GLM (Zhipu direct API)\u001b[23;4H(○) Kimi / Moonshot ▸ (Coding Plan, Moonshot global & China endpoints)\u001b[24;4H(○) StepFun Step Plan (Agent / coding models via Step Plan API)\u001b[25;4H(○) MiniMax ▸ (Global, OAuth Coding Plan & China endpoints)\u001b[26;4H(○) Ollama Cloud (Cloud-hosted open models, ollama.com)\u001b[27;4H(○) Arcee AI (Trinity models, direct API)\u001b[28;4H(○) GMI Cloud (Multi-model direct API)\u001b[29;4H(○) Kilo Code (Kilo Gateway API)"]
